@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Pull Requests and Code Reviews in Azure Repos";
    ViewData["ActiveMenu"] = "AzureDevOps";
}

<div class="container py-4">
    <h1 class="text-center text-primary">Pull Requests and Code Reviews in Azure Repos</h1>
    <p class="lead text-center">Learn how to manage pull requests and conduct efficient code reviews using Azure Repos.</p>
    <hr />

    <!-- Introduction -->
    <div class="mt-4">
        <h2 class="text-success">Introduction</h2>
        <p>
            Pull requests (PRs) in Azure Repos provide a way to review and merge code changes efficiently. Code reviews ensure better code quality, improve collaboration, and prevent bugs before deployment.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/azure-repos-pull-requests.jpg" alt="Azure Repos Pull Requests" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Pull requests streamline collaboration in development teams.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Creating a Pull Request -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-warning">Creating a Pull Request</h2>
        <p>Follow these steps to create a pull request in Azure Repos:</p>
        <ol class="list-group list-group-numbered">
            <li class="list-group-item">Go to your Azure DevOps project and navigate to Repos &rarr; Pull Requests.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Click "New Pull Request" and select the source and target branches.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Add a title, description, and reviewers.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item">Click "Create" to initiate the pull request.</li>
        </ol>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/creating-pull-request.jpg" alt="Creating a Pull Request" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Pull requests facilitate structured code merging.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Code Review Process -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-danger">Code Review Process</h2>
        <p>Effective code reviews help improve the quality of the software. Here’s how reviewers should proceed:</p>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Review Code Thoroughly:</strong> Check for functionality, security, and efficiency.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Leave Constructive Comments:</strong> Provide feedback and suggest improvements.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Approve or Request Changes:</strong> Approve if satisfactory or ask for revisions.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/code-review-process.jpg" alt="Code Review Process" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Code reviews ensure high-quality, maintainable code.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Best Practices -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-info">Best Practices for Pull Requests and Code Reviews</h2>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Keep Pull Requests Small:</strong> Large PRs are harder to review and merge.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Write Meaningful Descriptions:</strong> Explain the changes made and their impact.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Use Checklists:</strong> Ensure all important checks are covered before merging.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Encourage Team Collaboration:</strong> Involve multiple reviewers for better feedback.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/best-practices-pull-requests.jpg" alt="Best Practices for Pull Requests" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Following best practices leads to a better development workflow.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Conclusion -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-secondary">Conclusion</h2>
        <p>
            Pull requests and code reviews are essential for maintaining code quality and team collaboration in Azure Repos. Adopting best practices and using the built-in tools effectively can streamline the development process.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/azure-repos-summary.jpg" alt="Azure Repos Summary" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Azure Repos provides robust tools for code management and collaboration.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>